dates wasm_proto_input v1
description "An input named __proto__. The Wasm module takes the inputs as one JSON object, by their names, and a JavaScript object literal cannot carry the key: the module answers that the input is missing (W001). Every other target takes the inputs as parameters, by their aliases"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  __proto__(proto) : int range >=0 <=3

date due = received
  + __proto__ days
